# Build context for the Dockerfiles (they are built from the repository root).
# Docker reads only this file, so the per-service build contexts share it.

# Dependencies and build output are installed inside the images.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage

# Git, editor and OS files
.git
**/.DS_Store
.vscode
.idea

# Local secrets and databases never go into an image
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.db
**/*.db-journal
**/*.db-shm
**/*.db-wal
**/*.log

# Not needed in any image
docs
**/*.md
